{
  "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json",
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "pricing-workbench",
      "type": "registry:block",
      "docs": "Embeddable all-instrument workbench using shared schema forms, market editor, linked stored-node table/chart, cashflow and typed/raw result components. Host owns routes; defaultInstrumentType selects a canonical example without replacing supplied market/model parameters. Complete native-validated edits feed pricing; successful result/cashflow views retain their completed request.",
